Error [jet.HereSiteDefault]: A `#here` parameter default names the declaration, not the call.
  --> tests/ui/here_site_default.jet:4:45
    |
  4 | log: fn(message: String, at: SourceLocation{#here}) {
    |                                             ^^^^^
 Why: `#here` is the place where it is written, so every call that leaves the parameter out would get the default's own line.
 Fix: Write the default as `#caller` to get the place of each call.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2428
